# AGC SDD Workflow

Every F1.xx feature follows:

1. GitHub Issue
2. /speckit-specify
3. Specification review
4. /speckit-plan
5. Plan review
6. /speckit-tasks
7. /speckit-analyze
8. /speckit-implement
9. Verification
10. Pull Request
11. PRE validation
12. PRO deployment

## Stage Boundaries

### Specify
Produces `spec.md`.

After specification generation, stop.

Configured post-specification hooks may execute.

### Plan
Requires an approved `spec.md`.

Produces `plan.md`.

### Tasks
Requires an approved `plan.md`.

Produces `tasks.md`.

### Implementation
Requires:

- approved `spec.md`
- approved `plan.md`
- `tasks.md`
- satisfied feature dependencies

### Implementation completion

Implementation is not considered complete until
verification passes.